sentences.text:
12. Let the applicant-Indrasen Alias Karkau be released on bail in Case Crime No. 254 of 2022,
under Sections 363, 366, 376 IPC and 3/4 POCSO Act, Police Station Visheshvarganj, District Bahraich on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
13.

